  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Behind the Scenes. We begin backstage on finale night of the hit singing show Twelve Singers, before top media student Bu Xiaogu introduces herself and compares entering the workplace to jumping into a boiling hotpot. Listen to the scene first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这是谁的呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你到位没有？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "布小谷到位！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "观众朋友们，欢迎各位！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天是十二歌王决赛之夜！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我叫布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是传媒学院的研究生，年级第一名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "职场是一个火锅，想想真的够吓人的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "该下锅时还是得下！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这是谁的呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whose is this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "你到位没有？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you in position yet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "布小谷到位！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu is in position!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "观众朋友们，欢迎各位！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Friends in the audience, welcome everyone!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天是十二歌王决赛之夜！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tonight is the finals night of Twelve Singers!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我叫布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My name is Bu Xiaogu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是传媒学院的研究生，年级第一名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a graduate student at the Media College, first in my year.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "职场是一个火锅，想想真的够吓人的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The workplace is a hotpot; just thinking about it is scary enough.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "该下锅时还是得下！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When it is time to jump into the pot, you still have to jump in!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
